    <elementInformations/>
    <informations>This element was created using my own work while taking inspiration from publicly available CAD models shared by the community.
Special thanks to "Tine Logar" for sharing the "Dual-axis XY Joystick Module with push button model" on GrabCAD, which served as a reference during the design process.
Original model: https://grabcad.com/library/dual-axis-xy-joystick-module-with-push-button-112
License: see https://www.qelectrotech.org/wiki_new/doc/elements_license</informations>
